    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_cast_iron_sheet",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_CastIronSheet_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A Cast Iron Sheet from before Water-Driven Infrastructure switched to the shared Metal Sheet of CSFFModFramework. Within a quarter of an hour it becomes an Iron Sheet (a Metal Sheet of iron, Metal Type 200) by itself; Reforge as Metal Sheet does it at once. Nothing makes this card any more."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_cast_iron_sheet",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_CastIronSheet_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Retired:</b> Water-Driven Infrastructure no longer makes its own Cast Iron Sheet. Every WDI recipe now takes the shared Metal Sheet, the one CSFFModFramework ships for all mods. This old card turns into an Iron Sheet (a Metal Sheet of iron, Metal Type 200) by itself within a quarter of an hour, or at once with Reforge as Metal Sheet."
  },
